📄 Complete .gitignore File (Copy-Paste Ready)
Bhai, ye ek professional-level .gitignore hai jo tumhare Python + React + Node + SQLite project ke liye perfect hai. Isse tumhari sensitive files (.env, API keys, database, logs) GitHub pe kabhi upload nahi hongi.

📋 Full .gitignore File
Apne project ke root folder me .gitignore file kholo (C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-ai-platform\.gitignore) aur ye pura content paste kar do:

