🎯 Ye File Kya-Kya Rok Rahi Hai? (Explanation)
Category	Kya Rok Raha Hai	Kyun Important
🔐 Env Variables	.env, .env.local	Gemini API key leak na ho
🐍 Python	__pycache__/, venv/, *.pyc	Junk files GitHub pe na jaye
🗄️ Database	*.db, *.sqlite3	Local DB GitHub pe na jaye
📁 Storage	backend/storage/*	Generated artifacts (heavy files)
📝 Logs	*.log, backend/logs/	Runtime logs upload na ho
📦 Node	node_modules/, dist/	200MB+ folder GitHub pe na jaye
⚙️ IDE	.vscode/, .idea/	Personal settings personal rahe
🔒 Secrets	*.pem, *.key, credentials.json	Security certificates safe rahein
🚀 Ab Kya Karna Hai — Step by Step
Step 1: .gitignore File Update Karo
bash
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-ai-platform
VS Code me .gitignore file kholo → pura content delete karke upar wala paste kar do → Save (Ctrl+S).

Step 2: Pehle Se Committed Galat Files Ko Remove Karo
Tumne pehle commit kiya tha jisme .env files chali gayi thi. Unhe Git tracking se remove karna zaroori hai:

bash
# Remove .env files from tracking (files laptop pe rahengi, GitHub se hatengi)
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached backend/logs/app.log

# Agar koi DB file bhi commit hui ho
git rm --cached backend/*.db 2>$null

# Ab ye sab add karo
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: update .gitignore to exclude env, logs, and DB files"
git push
Step 3: storage folder me .gitkeep banao
Git khaali folders ko track nahi karta, isliye har storage subfolder me ek .gitkeep file banao:

bash
# Windows PowerShell
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/uploads/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/requirements/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/architecture/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/code/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/tests/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/security_reports/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/storage/deployments/.gitkeep" -Force

# Logs folder
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/logs/.gitkeep" -Force
Step 4: Commit Karo
bash
git add .
git commit -m "chore: add .gitkeep files to preserve empty directories"
git push
⚠️ IMPORTANT: Agar Gemini API Key .env Me Thi
Bhai dhyan se — agar tumne pehle push me real Gemini API key .env me daali thi aur wo GitHub pe chali gayi, to:

Turant apni purani key delete karo: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

Nayi key generate karo

Nayi key ko sirf apne laptop ke backend/.env file me daalo

GitHub pe kabhi mat daalo

GitHub pe push hone ke baad kuch seconds me bots keys scrape kar lete hain — chahe tum 1 second baad delete karo, compromise ho chuki hoti hai.

🔍 Verify Karo Ki Sab Sahi Hai
bash
# Check karo kaunsi files track ho rahi hain
git ls-files | Select-String ".env"

# Agar output empty hai to ✅ perfect
# Agar output me .env dikhe to abhi bhi tracked hai — Step 2 dobara karo
